WHAT: Adds test files for rematerialization patterns and additional OLS
init-overwrite patterns in Sonatina IR test suite.

WHY: Documents optimization opportunities for future passes. Rematerialization
(recomputing cheap values instead of keeping them on stack) would reduce SWAP
overhead. OLS loop patterns show where cross-block analysis is needed.

GAS IMPACT: None (test-only).

TEAM NOTES: These tests were written to guide implementation of remat and
cross-block OLS passes. Neither pass was implemented during this campaign —
the bigger wins came from Fe std library changes instead. The tests remain
as specifications for future work.
